    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your partner is dying of a horrific virus and only through the combined power of your fellow Crinchures can you save them!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more than 181 Crinchures, alongside hundreds of other items to collect (more than 700 by last count!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the deep past of this post-apocalyptic world to uncover the truths behind the disappearance of Humanity, and confront the darkness at the heart of it all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute, somewhat unsettling journey through a world beyond Capitalism</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free, older version of the game is playable in the browser on the Blushing Kitsune Basket itch.io page (or just look up Crinchure Collector there!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try-before-you-buy, if you'd like!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your partner is dying of a horrific virus and only through the combined power of your fellow Crinchures can you save them!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more than 181 Crinchures, alongside hundreds of other items to collect (more than 700 by last count!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the deep past of this post-apocalyptic world to uncover the truths behind the disappearance of Humanity, and confront the darkness at the heart of it all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute, somewhat unsettling journey through a world beyond Capitalism</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free, older version of the game is playable in the browser on the Blushing Kitsune Basket itch.io page (or just look up Crinchure Collector there!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try-before-you-buy, if you'd like!</p>",
